1
00:00:01,767 --> 00:00:02,933
OK.

2
00:00:03,033 --> 00:00:06,000
Let's make this project a success together.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,667
Thank you very much for your time.

4
00:00:10,133 --> 00:00:11,333
Here you go.

5
00:00:12,333 --> 00:00:13,867
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

6
00:00:14,533 --> 00:00:16,100
Thank you both.

7
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:19,300
Thanks to your help,
we finally made it in time.

8
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:22,400
Dad, is your schedule always this packed?

9
00:00:23,033 --> 00:00:25,367
No wonder you haven't
been able to return to Japan.

10
00:00:26,133 --> 00:00:28,900
Sorry for calling you over so suddenly.

11
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:31,700
You must be busy with university too.

12
00:00:32,033 --> 00:00:33,100
It's fine.

13
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:38,000
I was actually looking for
something to keep my mind occupied.

14
00:00:45,767 --> 00:00:48,267
Isn't it about time you
replied to Hinata's messages?

15
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:48,933
Hey!

16
00:00:49,033 --> 00:00:49,700
(Hinata: Senpai, is everything okay over
there?) (Are you getting enough rest?)

17
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:50,809
(Are you eating well? Sleeping enough?)
(How's your dad? Is work going smoothly?)

18
00:00:50,833 --> 00:00:51,400
(When are you coming back?)
(Still working? You must be busy.)

19
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:54,700
(Good luck with work!) Hey, shouldn't
you be a little worried about me too?

20
00:00:56,467 --> 00:00:57,567
Give it back.

21
00:01:02,467 --> 00:01:04,767
I don't deserve to be by his side.

22
00:01:06,533 --> 00:01:08,400
What, are you still dwelling on that?

23
00:01:09,733 --> 00:01:11,833
He saw me in that state.

24
00:01:11,933 --> 00:01:13,467
Any normal person would be freaked out.

25
00:01:16,867 --> 00:01:18,100
Huh?

26
00:01:19,133 --> 00:01:21,633
Do you really think Hinata is that kind of person?

27
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:24,800
What kind of person do you think Hinata is?

28
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:30,000
Ah, it's a good thing you
two are just a fake couple.

29
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:33,180
With the way you are now, I wouldn't
feel comfortable leaving Hinata with you.

30
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:37,233
He finally managed to turn down Oji Senpai.

31
00:01:38,433 --> 00:01:39,667
Huh?

32
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:43,200
If you want to know, go ask him yourself.

33
00:01:50,300 --> 00:01:52,733
So cute, it looks just like Senpai.

34
00:01:55,133 --> 00:01:56,733
Oh, this one is cute too.

35
00:01:56,833 --> 00:01:57,733
Excuse me!

36
00:01:57,833 --> 00:01:59,000
Hey.

37
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,433
Whoa!

38
00:02:09,533 --> 00:02:11,267
(Incoming Call: Sora)

39
00:02:25,533 --> 00:02:26,867
Senpai?

40
00:02:27,133 --> 00:02:30,767
I'm sorry for not keeping in touch.

41
00:02:30,867 --> 00:02:34,267
I heard from Riku that you're
helping your dad with work.

42
00:02:35,667 --> 00:02:36,933
Yeah.

43
00:02:38,467 --> 00:02:40,967
Senpai, have you been eating well?

44
00:02:41,067 --> 00:02:42,467
Getting enough sleep?

45
00:02:42,567 --> 00:02:44,407
You're not pushing
yourself too hard, are you?

46
00:02:46,133 --> 00:02:47,867
Listen, Hinata.

47
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:53,067
When I get back to Tokyo,

48
00:02:54,667 --> 00:02:56,533
there's something I want to tell you.

49
00:02:59,733 --> 00:03:01,067
Okay.

50
00:03:23,233 --> 00:03:27,367
♪ My feelings go up and down every day ♪

51
00:03:27,467 --> 00:03:31,133
♪ Only time keeps slipping away ♪

52
00:03:31,233 --> 00:03:34,967
♪ This love has long surpassed friendship ♪

53
00:03:35,067 --> 00:03:38,133
♪ This must be love ♪

54
00:03:38,233 --> 00:03:41,367
♪ This is my love ♪

55
00:03:41,633 --> 00:03:43,700
♪ On the campus slope ♪

56
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:48,933
♪ We used to be nameless strangers ♪

57
00:03:49,033 --> 00:03:51,067
♪ People passing by each other ♪

58
00:03:51,167 --> 00:03:56,200
♪ All rushing toward different futures ♪

59
00:03:56,300 --> 00:04:00,033
♪ After meeting you that summer ♪

60
00:04:00,133 --> 00:04:03,233
♪ Destiny began to turn ♪

61
00:04:03,333 --> 00:04:08,967
♪ Just go for it, yet I'm
still questioning myself ♪

62
00:04:09,067 --> 00:04:09,633
♪ I can't say it out loud ♪

63
00:04:09,733 --> 00:04:13,900
♪ If this is love, it's hard to speak of ♪

64
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:17,600
♪ What kind of expression
will you show tomorrow? ♪

65
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:22,800
♪ This love is no longer just friends ♪

66
00:04:22,900 --> 00:04:24,867
♪ This is love ♪

67
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:27,733
"Your Sky Hare nochi Koi"

68
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:36,933
(Episode 7: Endings and Beginnings)

69
00:04:42,233 --> 00:04:43,767
Sora Senpai.

70
00:04:43,867 --> 00:04:45,233
Hinata.

71
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,200
Welcome back.

72
00:04:49,067 --> 00:04:50,333
I'm back.

73
00:04:52,900 --> 00:04:54,867
Wait... can you see me?

74
00:04:56,033 --> 00:04:57,433
Riku, welcome back too.

75
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:10,500
Ah, I have something really
important to do, so I gotta run.

76
00:05:11,133 --> 00:05:13,233
Bye, I'll take this for you.

77
00:05:24,467 --> 00:05:25,833
Um...

78
00:05:26,133 --> 00:05:27,433
Yeah?

79
00:05:28,867 --> 00:05:33,233
We've been to so many places together.

80
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,467
Yeah, we have.

81
00:05:40,767 --> 00:05:42,367
I know this is a bit sudden,

82
00:05:43,300 --> 00:05:44,933
But I like you, Senpai.

83
00:05:47,967 --> 00:05:51,133
Even though we were just a
fake couple, before I knew it,

84
00:05:51,233 --> 00:05:53,100
you were all I could think about.

85
00:05:54,867 --> 00:05:58,900
Without realizing it, I
think I really fell for you.

86
00:06:03,267 --> 00:06:05,867
I'm terrible, aren't I?

87
00:06:06,833 --> 00:06:08,667
- Hinata.
- I'm sorry.

88
00:06:09,567 --> 00:06:11,067
This must be a burden for you.

89
00:06:12,300 --> 00:06:14,867
But I felt like if I didn't say it now,

90
00:06:14,967 --> 00:06:16,487
I'd regret it for the rest of my life.

91
00:06:19,367 --> 00:06:22,133
Besides, the situation with
Oji Senpai is already resolved.

92
00:06:22,700 --> 00:06:26,433
You don't have to force
yourself to date me anymore.

93
00:06:26,533 --> 00:06:28,833
- I never felt forced.
- So...

94
00:06:31,200 --> 00:06:35,967
Let's end this here.

95
00:06:40,767 --> 00:06:42,733
Thank you for everything
you've done for me.

96
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:46,967
Wait.

97
00:06:47,333 --> 00:06:48,667
Don't come any closer.

98
00:07:06,733 --> 00:07:08,400
This is just who I am.

99
00:07:09,733 --> 00:07:11,400
You're better off staying away from me.

100
00:07:18,767 --> 00:07:21,467
Bro, do you really think
Hinata is that kind of person?

101
00:07:22,567 --> 00:07:24,833
Do you really think Hinata is that kind of person?

102
00:07:32,033 --> 00:07:33,533
He's gone?

103
00:07:33,633 --> 00:07:36,367
Sorry, do you know where
Hinata might have gone?

104
00:07:37,767 --> 00:07:39,533
What the hell.

105
00:07:41,333 --> 00:07:42,600
Riku.

106
00:07:45,300 --> 00:07:47,200
Ah, sorry, sorry.

107
00:07:51,167 --> 00:07:53,800
By the way, what are you doing here before opening?

108
00:07:53,900 --> 00:07:56,600
Thought I'd come help out again.

109
00:07:56,700 --> 00:07:59,067
You just want to drink for free.

110
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:09,100
What?

111
00:08:09,200 --> 00:08:10,300
Oh, you're back.

112
00:08:10,400 --> 00:08:14,033
Is Hinata there?

113
00:08:14,133 --> 00:08:15,333
No, he didn't.

114
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,233
What's wrong?

115
00:08:21,267 --> 00:08:22,367
Yeah.

116
00:08:23,367 --> 00:08:25,267
I'll let you know if I hear anything.

117
00:08:25,833 --> 00:08:27,167
Um...

118
00:08:31,100 --> 00:08:34,700
Hearing him all flustered
like that, he's so innocent.

119
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:36,767
Yeah.

120
00:08:36,867 --> 00:08:38,633
Even Sora gets panicked.

121
00:08:45,333 --> 00:08:47,800
Love really does change people.

122
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,400
Huh?

123
00:09:02,533 --> 00:09:03,900
I'm sorry!

124
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,433
Hinata! Hinata!

125
00:09:05,533 --> 00:09:06,167
You scared me to death.

126
00:09:06,267 --> 00:09:07,900
That was too dangerous. Are you okay?

127
00:09:08,967 --> 00:09:10,267
Is he okay?

128
00:09:15,767 --> 00:09:17,900
Ah! I'm sorry.

129
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:19,400
Watch out.

130
00:09:22,747 --> 00:09:24,380
But your clothes…

131
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,700
Ready, set...

132
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:03,500
- Cocoa.
- Coffee.

133
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:05,333
The sky is so beautiful.

134
00:10:22,067 --> 00:10:23,400
Hinata.

135
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:26,833
Wait... hold on.

136
00:10:32,333 --> 00:10:34,373
Confessing and then
running away is totally unfair.

137
00:10:35,133 --> 00:10:37,533
I'm... sorry.

138
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:44,067
Did you mean everything you just said?

139
00:10:45,167 --> 00:10:46,767
I know.

140
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:52,067
I can't be with you, Senpai.

141
00:10:53,767 --> 00:10:56,533
I need to properly end
our current relationship.

142
00:10:57,133 --> 00:10:59,967
Yeah, you're right.

143
00:11:00,700 --> 00:11:03,200
Let's end this here.

144
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:07,367
Okay.

145
00:11:08,433 --> 00:11:09,433
So...

146
00:11:12,900 --> 00:11:15,100
Can't we date for real?

147
00:11:18,933 --> 00:11:20,167
Huh?

148
00:11:21,200 --> 00:11:22,867
Be real lovers.

149
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:27,367
Me and you?

150
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:30,200
Who else?

151
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:36,767
Senpai?

152
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:41,000
I've actually liked you for a long time.

153
00:11:42,467 --> 00:11:43,843
Even before we spoke for the first time,

154
00:11:43,867 --> 00:11:45,633
I already knew who you were.

155
00:11:49,233 --> 00:11:50,067
Are you okay?

156
00:11:50,167 --> 00:11:51,400
Thank you.

157
00:11:51,500 --> 00:11:52,300
Thank you.

158
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:53,067
You're welcome.

159
00:11:53,167 --> 00:11:56,267
Thank you...

160
00:11:56,367 --> 00:11:59,333
Wait, you mean me?

161
00:11:59,900 --> 00:12:01,033
Yeah.

162
00:12:01,633 --> 00:12:03,167
You knew all along, Senpai?

163
00:12:04,067 --> 00:12:07,133
Yeah, I've known for a while.

164
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:10,533
I also know you just can't
leave someone in trouble alone.

165
00:12:11,533 --> 00:12:13,700
And I knew you were hiding
in the locker room too.

166
00:12:14,767 --> 00:12:16,133
You noticed that?

167
00:12:16,233 --> 00:12:17,367
Yeah.

168
00:12:18,500 --> 00:12:21,600
Otherwise, I wouldn't have told Oji Senpai
that we were dating.

169
00:12:24,533 --> 00:12:25,967
Senpai.

170
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:30,667
So I had already decided
to tell you in person.

171
00:12:31,933 --> 00:12:34,167
But after what happened,

172
00:12:35,533 --> 00:12:37,100
I just couldn't bring myself to say it.

173
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:42,000
You must have been so scared back then.

174
00:12:50,367 --> 00:12:51,900
Because I've always known.

175
00:12:53,767 --> 00:12:55,567
Just how gentle you are, Senpai.

176
00:12:58,133 --> 00:12:59,533
Hinata.

177
00:13:05,100 --> 00:13:07,167
But you have to promise me one thing.

178
00:13:08,900 --> 00:13:10,980
Promise me you won't do that again.

179
00:13:13,267 --> 00:13:14,767
I promise.

180
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,167
I like you.

181
00:13:24,100 --> 00:13:25,367
Senpai.

182
00:13:42,667 --> 00:13:44,600
What's wrong? Is something weird?

183
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:46,767
It's nothing.

184
00:13:47,867 --> 00:13:52,500
I just feel like we're
shooting a romantic short film.

185
00:13:54,367 --> 00:13:55,367
You're right.

186
00:14:11,933 --> 00:14:13,433
Here.

187
00:14:13,733 --> 00:14:15,067
Thanks.

188
00:14:15,167 --> 00:14:16,333
Mhm.

189
00:14:21,700 --> 00:14:23,167
It's so good.

190
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:30,933
Let me have a sip too.

191
00:14:52,033 --> 00:14:54,967
A lover's kiss?

192
00:14:57,500 --> 00:14:58,833
Yeah.

193
00:15:07,933 --> 00:15:09,267
Senpai.

194
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:30,133
All right, that's enough for now.

195
00:16:31,967 --> 00:16:33,300
Jeez.

196
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:35,667
Don't scare me like that.

197
00:16:36,400 --> 00:16:38,333
It's still too early for
you, Hinata, isn't it?

198
00:16:39,867 --> 00:16:42,233
Don't treat me like a kid.

199
00:16:43,767 --> 00:16:44,933
So it's fine then?

200
00:16:48,100 --> 00:16:49,467
You're terrible.

201
00:16:49,567 --> 00:16:50,867
I'm just kidding.

202
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:54,333
Let's wait until Hinata is ready.

203
00:17:02,067 --> 00:17:03,967
Until then, I'll wait for you.

204
00:17:23,833 --> 00:17:25,133
Wake up.

205
00:17:26,333 --> 00:17:27,767
Mmm...

206
00:17:31,333 --> 00:17:32,700
Come on, let's go home.

207
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:35,167
No, I want to stay here.

208
00:17:36,667 --> 00:17:37,567
Then I'm going back by myself.

209
00:17:37,667 --> 00:17:39,633
No, Makoto has to stay with me too!

210
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:55,667
Are you serious?

211
00:17:57,967 --> 00:17:59,133
Huh?

212
00:18:00,867 --> 00:18:02,833
Don't blame me.

213
00:18:16,933 --> 00:18:18,400
You're so sneaky.

214
00:18:19,367 --> 00:18:20,700
So cute.

215
00:18:24,233 --> 00:18:25,633
Shut up.

216
00:18:26,733 --> 00:18:28,167
Look at me.

217
00:18:30,433 --> 00:18:31,867
No.

218
00:18:37,433 --> 00:18:38,333
I'm going home.

219
00:18:38,433 --> 00:18:39,633
Tasuku?

220
00:18:41,300 --> 00:18:42,667
What?

221
00:18:45,700 --> 00:18:47,067
Here.

222
00:18:54,800 --> 00:18:56,067
What the heck?

223
00:19:01,233 --> 00:19:03,600
(Funase)

224
00:19:05,967 --> 00:19:07,367
So?

225
00:19:07,667 --> 00:19:10,333
We're officially dating.

226
00:19:11,367 --> 00:19:15,033
Really? That's great!

227
00:19:16,333 --> 00:19:17,667
What's wrong?

228
00:19:17,767 --> 00:19:19,400
Is something still bothering you?

229
00:19:21,533 --> 00:19:24,900
I don't know if our parents will accept it.

230
00:19:26,733 --> 00:19:28,500
Listen to me, Hinata.

231
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:32,067
You didn't do anything wrong.

232
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:36,400
Just trust Sora and face
them with your head held high.

233
00:19:36,500 --> 00:19:38,533
No matter how long it takes,

234
00:19:38,633 --> 00:19:41,100
you guys will definitely get through this.

235
00:19:44,900 --> 00:19:47,100
Thanks, sis.

236
00:19:50,200 --> 00:19:51,767
- I'm heading out.
- Okay.

237
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:53,633
Hina.

238
00:19:53,733 --> 00:19:55,433
You forgot something.

239
00:19:55,533 --> 00:19:56,900
Thanks.

240
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,467
Hmm?

241
00:19:58,567 --> 00:20:00,633
You seem to be in a good mood.

242
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:02,267
Do I?

243
00:20:02,367 --> 00:20:05,100
Wait, are you seeing someone?

244
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:09,167
Come on, stop teasing me.

245
00:20:09,267 --> 00:20:11,833
What's there to be shy about?

246
00:20:11,933 --> 00:20:13,767
What kind of person are they?

247
00:20:13,867 --> 00:20:15,367
Hmm? Are they the cute type?

248
00:20:15,467 --> 00:20:17,367
Or the handsome type?

249
00:20:17,467 --> 00:20:19,700
Alright, stop asking.

250
00:20:19,800 --> 00:20:20,967
I'm leaving!

251
00:20:21,067 --> 00:20:22,400
Have a safe trip.

252
00:20:28,667 --> 00:20:30,633
How are things with you and Hinata lately?

253
00:20:30,733 --> 00:20:33,433
Well... pretty good, I guess.

254
00:20:33,533 --> 00:20:34,933
Have you guys gone anywhere?

255
00:20:35,033 --> 00:20:36,600
Yeah, just to cafes and stuff.

256
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:39,700
Sora.

257
00:20:39,767 --> 00:20:40,300
Hey.

258
00:20:40,433 --> 00:20:41,433
Hey.

259
00:20:51,133 --> 00:20:52,200
Take it.

260
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:53,367
Huh?

261
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,667
What's this about?

262
00:21:06,467 --> 00:21:10,400
We're not a fake couple anymore.

263
00:21:10,500 --> 00:21:12,367
We're actually dating now.

264
00:21:12,467 --> 00:21:13,967
- Oh.
- Nice.

265
00:21:14,067 --> 00:21:14,967
Finally.

266
00:21:15,067 --> 00:21:16,367
You finally said it properly.

267
00:21:16,467 --> 00:21:18,027
- Yeah.
- But if it weren't for my help,

268
00:21:18,067 --> 00:21:19,900
who knows what would've happened.

269
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:20,367
Huh?

270
00:21:20,467 --> 00:21:21,200
How did you help?

271
00:21:21,300 --> 00:21:22,500
It's a secret.

272
00:21:23,033 --> 00:21:25,067
- Excuse me!
- (In Thai) I'm so sorry!"

273
00:21:25,167 --> 00:21:26,267
Go ahead.

274
00:21:33,433 --> 00:21:34,233
Teerak.

275
00:21:34,333 --> 00:21:35,167
Come here.

276
00:21:35,267 --> 00:21:36,776
Pha Senpai, have you been waiting long?

277
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:38,267
No, I just got here too.

278
00:21:39,100 --> 00:21:40,700
I even bought rice balls.

279
00:21:41,533 --> 00:21:42,933
Have you seen them before?

280
00:21:43,467 --> 00:21:43,967
I don't know.

281
00:21:44,067 --> 00:21:45,767
Are they international students?

282
00:21:46,433 --> 00:21:47,476
The vibe those two give off...

283
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:49,309
- They're just like Hinata and my brother.
- (In Thai) Are you ready?

284
00:21:49,333 --> 00:21:50,433
(In Thai) Ready…

285
00:21:50,533 --> 00:21:52,367
- I think so too.
- (In Thai) Choo choo~"

286
00:21:52,467 --> 00:21:53,567
- They're so alike.
- (In Thai) Choo choo~"

287
00:21:54,067 --> 00:21:55,067
Really?

288
00:21:55,167 --> 00:21:56,367
Very alike, totally.

289
00:21:57,267 --> 00:21:58,533
Ah~.

290
00:21:58,633 --> 00:21:59,800
So cute.

291
00:22:00,200 --> 00:22:01,200
Mmm~.

292
00:22:01,267 --> 00:22:02,667
(In Thai) Is it good?

293
00:22:02,767 --> 00:22:03,633
Yeah.

294
00:22:03,733 --> 00:22:04,867
Huh?

295
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:07,733
Sorry, I've been lying to you guys.

296
00:22:08,800 --> 00:22:11,700
We only pretended to
date to avoid Oji Senpai.

297
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:14,533
What the heck? You could've just told us.

298
00:22:14,633 --> 00:22:16,500
That's because you have a big mouth.

299
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:17,767
Shut up!

300
00:22:19,667 --> 00:22:21,033
What happened?

301
00:22:21,133 --> 00:22:23,033
It's nothing!

302
00:22:23,133 --> 00:22:26,100
They were just pretending at first,
but then they actually became a couple.

303
00:22:26,467 --> 00:22:28,333
Doesn't it feel like a TV drama?

304
00:22:29,667 --> 00:22:30,667
Must be nice.

305
00:22:30,733 --> 00:22:32,900
Hey, Riku, wait a sec.

306
00:22:33,000 --> 00:22:35,067
Don't tell me you like Hinata?

307
00:22:35,167 --> 00:22:36,167
No way.

308
00:22:36,333 --> 00:22:40,167
Ah, did it make you
want to fall in love too?

309
00:22:42,500 --> 00:22:44,433
I'm single, how about me?

310
00:22:44,533 --> 00:22:45,300
Shut up!

311
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:46,433
Why?

312
00:22:47,100 --> 00:22:49,167
I think we're actually a pretty good match.

313
00:22:49,267 --> 00:22:50,827
Forget it, we're better off as friends.

314
00:22:50,867 --> 00:22:51,933
No, no.

315
00:22:52,033 --> 00:22:53,233
Sorry for the wait.

316
00:22:53,867 --> 00:22:55,367
That's so nice.

317
00:22:55,767 --> 00:22:57,467
Let's just leave it at that.

318
00:22:59,267 --> 00:23:00,467
- Here.
- Thanks.

319
00:23:00,567 --> 00:23:01,133
Bye.

320
00:23:01,233 --> 00:23:02,267
Let me carry your bag.

321
00:23:03,133 --> 00:23:04,367
So, Riku...

322
00:23:04,467 --> 00:23:08,167
Ah, Senpai, you have
something on your head.

323
00:23:10,167 --> 00:23:11,333
Thanks.

324
00:23:12,133 --> 00:23:13,367
There we go.

325
00:23:15,300 --> 00:23:16,767
Where to next?

326
00:23:17,467 --> 00:23:18,700
Oh, right.

327
00:23:21,300 --> 00:23:23,100
(In Thai) Are those two dating?

328
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,600
(In Thai) They look so cute together.

329
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:27,133
(In Thai) Yeah... I think so too.

330
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:28,943
(In Thai) It feels like looking at ourselves.

331
00:23:28,967 --> 00:23:31,300
(In Thai) Yeah, I feel the same way.

332
00:23:32,367 --> 00:23:33,567
Well...

333
00:23:44,233 --> 00:23:45,800
It's about time Hinata...

334
00:24:49,500 --> 00:24:50,200
(Next Episode)
No matter what happens,

335
00:24:50,300 --> 00:24:51,709
I want to face it together with you.

336
00:24:51,733 --> 00:24:54,267
I want to be with you forever.

337
00:24:54,367 --> 00:24:56,076
(Hinata's family is falling apart!?)
Dad, Senpai didn't do anything...

338
00:24:56,100 --> 00:24:57,567
Stay away from my son!

339
00:24:57,667 --> 00:24:59,433
What's so wrong with this?

340
00:25:02,734 --> 00:25:04,733
- Alright, yay!
- Yay!

341
00:25:04,734 --> 00:25:06,733
As for hobbies...

342
00:25:06,734 --> 00:25:09,332
- I love good food.
- Eating...

343
00:25:09,333 --> 00:25:11,666
Our common ground is
that we both love yakiniku.

344
00:25:11,667 --> 00:25:13,999
After I mentioned that I
like going to the sauna...

345
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:16,299
I heard he actually went
to the sauna this morning.

346
00:25:16,300 --> 00:25:19,999
Riku is really sweet.

347
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:23,900
- No, really... that's how it is.
- He's so handsome.

348
00:25:37,533 --> 00:25:41,499
- He makes my heart flutter.
- He's practically an angel.

349
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:43,833
- We have two angels right here.
- Everything is just too cute.

350
00:25:43,834 --> 00:25:45,833
He kept squishing the rice ball like this.

351
00:25:45,834 --> 00:25:48,034
- While saying, "When can I finally eat this?"
- Hahaha.
